Formatter _load_template builds the path as endpoint_name.yml only. 44 templates per language use the .yaml extension (308 files total across 7 langs), so those endpoints silently fall back to a raw YAML dump instead of rendering their template. Affects bundeshaushalt, all luftqualitaet, all hilfsmittel, eco_visio, all pflanzenschutzmittelzulassung, bundesrat, smard, regionalatlas, ladestationen_query. No basename collisions between .yml and .yaml. Fix: make _load_template try .yml first then .yaml. Prereq for the template-render verification in tickets 3 and 7. Found during Phase 2 batch.

